      <description><![CDATA[<p>Week 90 (2026-07-21), packet J-4. One audio file with 5 chapters.</p><ol><li><strong>0:00</strong> <a href="https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/etBrzxdfNop3DqJvA/guardians-of-the-truth">Guardians of the Truth</a> by Eliezer Yudkowsky</li><li><strong>9:04</strong> <a href="https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/aFtWRL3QihoF5uQd5/guardians-of-the-gene-pool">Guardians of the Gene Pool</a> by Eliezer Yudkowsky</li><li><strong>11:05</strong> <a href="https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/96TBXaHwLbFyeAxrg/guardians-of-ayn-rand">Guardians of Ayn Rand</a> by Eliezer Yudkowsky</li><li><strong>22:24</strong> <a href="https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/Qr4MB9hFRzamuMRHJ/two-cult-koans">Two Cult Koans</a> by Eliezer Yudkowsky</li><li><strong>26:31</strong> (Optional) <a href="https://calteches.library.caltech.edu/51/2/CargoCult.htm">Cargo Cult Science</a> by Richard Feynman</li></ol><p>Audio sources: <a href="https://intelligence.org/razfeed-Updated.rss">MIRI official R:AZ audiobook</a>; <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yvfAtIJbatg">C0nc0rdance on YouTube</a>.</p><p>Audio licensing: <a href="https://intelligence.org/razfeed-Updated.rss">Rationality: From AI to Zombies audiobook</a> by Machine Intelligence Research Institute, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/">CC BY-NC-SA 3.0</a>; <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yvfAtIJbatg">Cargo Cult Science narration</a> by C0nc0rdance, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/">CC BY 3.0</a>.</p>]]></description>
